classDiagram
direction LR
class JobConfig {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +str job_id
  +AuthMode auth_mode
  +AudioRecord audio
  +RecognitionOptions recognition_options
  +EnhancementConfig enhancement
  +str json_directory
  +str document_directory
  +CONFIGURED status
  +False execution_authorized
}
class AudioRecord {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +str path
  +AudioMetadata metadata
  +FileFingerprint fingerprint
  +bool requires_mono
  +str name
}
class EnhancementConfig {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +EnhancementMode mode
  +HotwordConfig_or_None hotwords
  +str_or_None context
}
class ConfirmationReceipt {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +str job_id
  +str config_path
  +AuthMode auth_mode
  +str json_directory
  +str document_directory
  +bool execution_started
}
class ExecutionReport {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +str job_id
  +Literal status
  +ResultSummary result
  +ErrorReport error
  +ErrorReport record_error
  +DeliveryReport delivery
  +bool documents_ready
}
class DeliveryReport {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +Literal status
  +str message
  +dict~str,DocumentReport~ files
}
class DocumentReport {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +READY_or_FAILED status
  +str path
  +int bytes
  +str message
  +str error_type
}
JobConfig --> AudioRecord : 已预览音频
JobConfig --> EnhancementConfig : 即时增强内容
JobConfig ..> ConfirmationReceipt : Session.confirm保存后返回
JobConfig ..> ExecutionReport : transcribe使用确认快照
ExecutionReport --> DeliveryReport : JSON成功后附加交付结果
DeliveryReport --> "0..3" DocumentReport : xlsx／docx／md
note for JobConfig "scripts/asr_runtime/models.py<br/>TypedDict描述现有JSON协议；运行时仍为普通dict<br/>图中选择影响任务边界的字段，完整定义见源码<br/>API Key保存在工作目录/.asr-transcription/.env<br/>凭据独立于JobConfig"
note for AudioRecord "name在基础音频检查后由Session补充<br/>metadata与fingerprint保存已检查事实<br/>执行阶段使用同一配置核对输入"
note for ConfirmationReceipt "网页与Codex取得同一job_id和输出位置<br/>execution_started=false表示尚未调用BL<br/>图03展示回执的HTTP与stdout交付"
note for ExecutionReport "status使用Literal约束允许状态，转换见图07<br/>result、error、record_error、delivery等为NotRequired<br/>字段可以缺失；结构与业务检查由读取边界负责"
note for DocumentReport "READY携带path和bytes；FAILED携带公开说明和类型<br/>这些明细字段在代码中使用NotRequired<br/>OUTCOME_UNKNOWN交付回执可以缺少files"
